WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.940
- So in addition to
Rob's backstage popcorn,

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:05.340
the brothers have been working
on another exciting venture.

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.860
They're upcoming residency in Las Vegas.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.407
(audience applauding)

00:00:09.407 --> 00:00:11.490
I'm so excited to come see this.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.350
Like I said I loved your show so much

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:14.183
when I saw you at the Bowl.

00:00:14.183 --> 00:00:15.510
So, I am so stoked about this.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.061
What's new?

00:00:17.061 --> 00:00:18.120
What's gonna be happening?

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:18.953
- Well, there's a lot.

00:00:18.953 --> 00:00:22.350
I mean, we haven't played a
show since October last year

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:23.520
and so we're obviously very excited

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.960
to get back on the stage

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.330
and this residency was actually supposed

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.490
to happen pre COVID and then COVID hit.

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:31.500
So this is a long time overdue for us

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.660
to bring an exciting
show to our fans in Vegas

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:36.240
and it's a great town for live music

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.445
and I just can't wait to
get out there and play.

00:00:37.445 --> 00:00:38.278
(audience applauding)

00:00:38.278 --> 00:00:41.026
- Oh my God, so this was
supposed a long time ago.

00:00:41.026 --> 00:00:41.859
Oh, man.

00:00:41.859 --> 00:00:43.800
- Maybe some special guests, maybe Jona.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.030
- That's exciting.

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:46.987
Don't invite me, mama will show up.

00:00:46.987 --> 00:00:48.485
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:48.485 --> 00:00:50.040
- It's how things get done there.

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:52.740
- I will just show up, I'm
just gonna show up singing.

